"""
The public `std::wire` facade for bounded binary communication.

The facade contains no operating-system, filesystem, transport, application,
or cryptographic dependency. It exports only fixed-width frame metadata,
typed protocol failures, and the deterministic checksum operation. Callers
own all input and output buffers; this module performs no hidden allocation.
"""
"""Re-export typed failures for malformed or unsupported wire frames."""
open error;

"""Re-export the versioned fixed-width frame layout and protocol constants."""
open frame;

"""Re-export the allocation-free CRC16-CCITT integrity calculation."""
open checksum;

"""Re-export deterministic fixed-width header encoding and decoding."""
open codec;
